It is a port to a Domoticz plugin of the Home Assistant integration
"Lux-Alert-HACS-integration" by koosoli, https://github.com/koosoli/Lux-Alert-HACS-integration,
which reads the LU-Alert warnings of the Luxembourg government.

What the plugin takes from that integration is the idea, the choice of data
source (the data.public.lu dataset "Alertes du système LU-Alert"), the mapping
of the LU-Alert levels to severities, and the rules for test messages, expired
and old alerts, cancel/update references and the watchlist. The code is written
anew in Python for Domoticz (standard library only); no source file of the
integration is copied.

NOTE: the repository of that integration carries no licence file. Before this
project is published, the author of the integration should be asked to confirm
that the port may be distributed (or to add a licence); this notice is the
attribution until then.

The alert data are published by the Government of the Grand Duchy of Luxembourg
on data.public.lu; see the licence given on the dataset page.
